CalculatedLegExecutionID Alphanumeric 249 20 # Trade ID of the calculated leg
RoutedUserKey Integer 269 4 # Routed user (OBO)

MessageType 4 8 1 # GapFill: sent in place of messages not resent (UST OUCH 10.19, p.34; 5.5.1, p.9)
NewSeqNo Integer 9 4 # Sequence number of the next message to be transmitted
ReasonCode Alpha 13 1 # 1 NOT_RESENDABLE (Logon, Logout, Heartbeat), 2 NOT_AVAILABLE

### end
